a16z-anduril-industries:greenhouse:51616.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anduril operates at a pace unmatched in the defense industry. Consistent with this high-velocity growth, members of Anduril’s Legal team must be exceptionally resourceful, creative, and driven to take immediate ownership of highly complex and time-sensitive matters. This role demands a senior legal professional with a relentless drive to lead initiatives and move a substantial volume of projects forward at an aggressive pace. You will require outstanding negotiating, drafting, and strategic project management skills to coordinate and efficiently close critical transactions on extremely tight timelines, with a singular focus on enabling Anduril to rapidly deploy its cutting-edge technology into operational settings for the United States and its allies. Our team thrives on leveraging innovative solutions and advanced IT tools to enhance efficiency and collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE JOB&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly experienced and strategically-minded Senior Legal Counsel, Strategic Real Estate to join Anduril’s rapidly expanding Legal team. This is a critical leadership role for a seasoned real estate attorney, responsible for guiding Anduril’s significant and accelerating physical footprint expansion. You will serve as the key attorney and strategic partner to our strategic real estate and facilities teams, focusing primarily on complex, high-value, and strategic tenant-side real estate leasing transactions, property holdings, and overseeing construction projects. You will not just advise, but actively lead negotiations, structure deals, and innovate legal strategies to secure optimal terms for Anduril.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your expertise will be crucial in navigating intricate real estate landscapes, negotiating and ensuring compliance with state and local tax incentives, and acting as the strategic bridge between finance and operations to maximize benefits. You will possess a mastery of all forms of commercial real estate leases, a strong understanding of property acquisitions/dispositions, and familiarity with construction contracts (including AIA forms). This role demands a candidate who can independently manage a heavy workload, make rapid decisions, and consistently provide clear, actionable, executive-level guidance on complex risks and recommended courses of action. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a senior, strategic legal advisor and leader within Anduril’s dynamic Legal team, driving key real estate initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and strategically manage all legal aspects of Anduril’s complex tenant-side real estate leasing portfolio, including negotiating, structuring, and drafting high-value leases, sublease agreements, and associated real estate transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert legal counsel on property acquisitions, dispositions, and strategic real estate development projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee legal aspects of construction contracts and projects, ensuring favorable terms for Anduril as an owner/tenant, with a working knowledge of common contractor templates (e.g., AIA forms).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement legal strategies for securing and optimizing state and local tax incentives related to real estate, actively bridging finance and operations to ensure full realization of benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently lead and manage legal due diligence for all strategic real estate deals and construction bids, identifying critical issues and presenting solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on and strategically manage dispute resolution related to real estate and construction matters, aiming for proactive mitigation and efficient resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Anduril’s real estate and construction activities strictly comply with all applicable laws, regulations, and where relevant, government defense contracting requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement by establishing and refining legal frameworks, SOPs, templates, and processes to streamline reviews and support exponential growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage closely with our compliance function to ensure adherence to environmental laws and zoning requirements for all properties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently provide concise, high-impact executive-level briefings on key legal risks, strategic options, and recommended courses of action to senior leadership, enabling swift, informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with and provide strategic guidance to the real estate, facilities, and finance teams on all contracts and negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Juris Doctor (JD) degree from a top-tier accredited law school.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 10 years of focused experience as a lawyer with significant expertise in complex, tenant-side commercial real estate leasing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active membership in good standing with the bar in at least one U.S. state, with the ability to become authorized to practice in California (e.g., through California Bar membership or California Registered In-House Counsel status).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of commercial real estate lease agreements, including a deep understanding of market terms, negotiation strategies, and creative solutions for complex scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to thrive in a high-volume, rapidly evolving environment, expertly juggling a substantial portfolio of diverse projects and driving them to completion with urgency and precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated capacity to go above and beyond, anticipating needs, proactively identifying solutions, and taking initiative to overcome obstacles to ensure project momentum and strategic outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional proficiency with a wide array of modern IT tools, including advanced capabilities in Microsoft Word, Excel, PowerPoint, and enterprise communication/collaboration platforms like Slack. Candidate must be immediately productive with these tools; formal training will not be provided.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior negotiation, drafting, and verbal communication skills, with a meticulous attention to detail and the ability to articulate complex legal concepts clearly and concisely to non-legal audiences and executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to provide independent, high-level legal advice and strategic recommendations to executive leadership on critical business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing and able to work in Anduril’s Costa Mesa, California office full-time. Our team thrives on in-person collaboration, therefore remote or hybrid arrangements are not available for this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience as a lawyer with a focus on strategic tenant-side real estate leasing and portfolio management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-house experience within a high-growth technology, manufacturing, or defense company with a significant real estate footprint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working at a start-up or ability to establish sophisticated templates and processes from scratch in a rapidly scaling environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with land use, zoning regulations, and environmental laws as they apply to large-scale real estate development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Defense companies, Robotics, Technology, or other manufacturing-heavy companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$191,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$253,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an &lt;code&gt;@anduril.com&lt;/code&gt; address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is @anduril.com before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:contact@anduril.com&quot;&gt;contact@anduril.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

a16z-anduril-industries:greenhouse:51657.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;Anduril&#39;s Growth organization identifies, shapes, captures, and grows new opportunities for the company.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role sits within the &lt;strong&gt;Connected Warfare Division&lt;/strong&gt;. Connected Warfare builds the software and hardware substrate for global, multi-domain command and control (C2) — joint, time-sensitive, connected mesh ecosystems that link every robot, human, and sensor across every domain to close kill chains and enable mission autonomy. The division includes the Voyager team, which delivers ruggedised computing and communications platforms for the network edge.&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About the Job&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a sales role. You are here to hunt and close new business for Connected Warfare across Europe and the Middle East.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in continental Europe, you&#39;ll report to the Head of Growth for Anduril&#39;s International Connected Warfare business. You carry initial responsibility for the region, with scope to expand as the business scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;European defence environments come with sovereign requirements, legacy architectures, and security constraints. You will know these pain points cold and demonstrate how Anduril integrates with — and supercharges — the systems customers already operate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The work is matrixed: you&#39;ll pull on programs, engineering, capture, software, finance, partners, and customers to win. The deliverable is unambiguous: pipeline, partners, and signed contracts. This is an &lt;strong&gt;individual-contributor role&lt;/strong&gt; — no direct reports. Your impact is measured in the business you build and the contracts you close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive go-to-market.&lt;/strong&gt; Stand up and execute the Connected Warfare growth strategy across Europe and the Middle East. Identify, qualify, shape, and close complex opportunities with Allied nations, navigating international procurement cycles and sovereign requirements to secure long-term programs of record.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate and capture new business.&lt;/strong&gt; Run a dual-track motion: hunt and close net-new customers across the region while partnering with delivery teams to scale and expand current contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Map customer requirements.&lt;/strong&gt; Build a working understanding of regional defence requirements, security constraints, and legacy architectures. Show how Anduril&#39;s open architecture integrates with sovereign systems to solve real operational problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and manage the regional channel.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, onboard, and manage strategic partners, resellers, system integrators, and European primes. Coordinate with Anduril&#39;s Global Defense team on teaming agreements that accelerate adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the internal matrix.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain close working relationships across business line and division leadership, growth, programs, engineering, and corporate functions to shape opportunities and unblock execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver the number.&lt;/strong&gt; Hit financial performance targets and build the multi-year plan to back them up. Provide leadership with long-term growth and product strategy for Connected Warfare in region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inform product.&lt;/strong&gt; Translate region-specific mission profiles, sovereign cloud requirements, and degraded-network realities back into the product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent Anduril.&lt;/strong&gt; Communicate technical and operational value to senior military officials, procurement officers, and partners — articulating how Lattice-enabled C2 closes kill chains in contested environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Activities&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Salesforce as the system of record — accounts, pricing, points of contact, expected close dates, and all customer activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales Engineering to refine customer solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform live and static demonstrations on-site or via VTC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and deliver client presentations and proposals tailored to specific customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify regional contract vehicles (e.g. NATO frameworks, national procurement programmes) and lead proposal development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in defence, dual-use, or enterprise networking sales, with at least 5 years closing business with European government and military customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven hunter: documented record of identifying, qualifying, and closing complex deals with European Ministries of Defence (MoDs), NATO bodies, or coalition partners — opened the door, shaped the requirement, closed the contract&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with European defence procurement cycles, budgeting, and sovereign security frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly master highly technical concepts (mesh networking, edge compute, C2, cloud architecture) and credibly brief senior military and technical leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder with high agency: has stood up a regional pipeline, country, or business line from a standing start — not just managed an existing book. Owns outcomes, prioritizes ruthlessly, operates well in greenfield environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operates effectively in a matrixed organization — partners well with BL leadership, engineering, capture, and corporate functions. Low ego, high collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience building and managing a regional channel — resellers, system integrators, and prime partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of capture management or an equivalent enterprise sales pursuit methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-cultural communication and negotiation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or fluent English; a second European language (Dutch, German, French) or Arabic is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 50% across Europe and the Middle East&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right to work in the EU; eligible to obtain and maintain EU and/or NATO-level security clearances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior operational or industry experience in C4ISR, JADC2, or tactical communications — including service in an allied military, intelligence, or government digital/IT function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established network within European military headquarters, defence procurement agencies, and European defence primes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting export-controlled programs (US ITAR / EAR, UK Export Control, EU dual-use) and navigating sovereign data residency / cloud hosting regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up a new sales region for a defence-tech or enterprise networking company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Europe and the Middle East are rearming. The next decade of defence spend in this region will be measured in the billions, and the contracts being shaped right now will run for twenty years. We&#39;re hiring the person who&#39;s going to win our share of it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
