&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About MISUMI Americas&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MISUMI Americas, a division of MISUMI Group, is a leading provider of standard, configurable, and custom manufacturing solutions. By integrating a vast catalog of components with a world-class digital manufacturing platform, MISUMI Americas empowers engineers and procurement teams to accelerate innovation across the entire product lifecycle. With operations in the San Francisco Bay Area and Chicago, the company serves as a vital partner for the most innovative companies in the Americas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer – AI Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Oakland, CA (Onsite – HQ)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Artificial Intelligence&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Director of Engineering, AI&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fictiv is reimagining how manufacturing works in an AI-first world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI Innovation Team operates like an internal startup—focused on discovering, validating, and scaling entirely new product capabilities across both Fictiv and Misumi. This isn’t about incremental improvements or maintaining existing systems. It’s about identifying what &lt;em&gt;should exist next&lt;/em&gt; and building it from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer on this team, you’ll work on early-stage ideas, rapidly turning concepts into functional prototypes, testing them with real users, and evolving the strongest signals into production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re energized by ambiguity, driven by impact, and motivated by building things that don’t yet exist, this role is designed for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discover and define high-leverage AI opportunities across manufacturing and supply chain workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build rapid prototypes using real-world company data to test new product ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and iterate on LLM-powered systems, focusing on usability, reliability, and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate directly with customers and internal stakeholders to validate real-world use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform validated concepts into scalable, production-ready systems with engineering partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore emerging AI models, tools, and frameworks to push the boundaries of what’s possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture learnings, system designs, and experiment results to support long-term scaling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to shaping the AI roadmap across Fictiv and Misumi&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building and shipping LLM-based applications used in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in modern development environments (TypeScript/JavaScript and AWS preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prompt design and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LLM evaluation and testing methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guardrails, reliability patterns, and system design for AI applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of designing experiments and using data to validate technical decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Authorization to work in the U.S. without current or future sponsorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI-first products end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working across multiple languages, tools, and architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with large, unstructured, or messy datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in applied machine learning or AI systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think like a builder and an owner, not just an implementer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re motivated by solving real business problems—not just writing code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You move quickly, test ideas early, and learn from real-world feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable operating with limited structure and evolving direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You challenge assumptions—including your own—and iterate based on evidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly and bring others along in your thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Oakland, CA (onsite collaboration expected)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimal (0–10%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary range: &lt;strong&gt;$160,000 – $200,000&lt;/strong&gt;, depending on experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical and dental coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and leave programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re actively seeking teammates who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring diverse perspectives and experience to our culture and company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at being part of a strong, empathetic team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in an environment emphasizing respect, honesty, collaboration, and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an ‘always learning’ mindset that celebrates learning, not just wins.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help us continue to build a world-class organization that values the contributions of all of our teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage applications from members of underrepresented groups, including but not limited to women, members of the LGBTQ community, people of color, people with disabilities, and veterans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

g2vp-fictiv:greenhouse:8499797002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About MISUMI Americas&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MISUMI Americas, a division of MISUMI Group, is a leading provider of standard, configurable, and custom manufacturing solutions. By integrating a vast catalog of components with a world-class digital manufacturing platform, MISUMI Americas empowers engineers and procurement teams to accelerate innovation across the entire product lifecycle. With operations in the San Francisco Bay Area and Chicago, the company serves as a vital partner for the most innovative companies in the Americas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;List at least two comparative wins for this role over another that someone might consider. Example follows.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity To Unlock Your Creativity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Think of all the times you were held back from trying new ideas because you were boxed in by bureaucratic legacy processes or old school tactics. Having a growth mindset is deeply ingrained into our company culture since day 1 so Fictiv is an environment where you have the creative liberty and support of the team to try big bold ideas to achieve our sales and customer goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity To Grow Your Career&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;There are plenty of jobs out there. The question is whether any of them will help you grow in your career? Will you be challenged by teammates to achieve your potential? Or are they roles that will ask you to do more of what you&#39;ve already mastered. At Fictiv, you&#39;ll be surrounded by supportive teammates who will push you to be your best through their curiosity and passion.&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Impact In This Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;As a Salesforce engineering leader at Fictiv, you will build and manage high-performing teams by making strategic, culture-aligned hiring decisions and using data to optimize capacity. You’ll foster an environment of ownership and continuous learning, coaching Scrum teams in Agile excellence to ensure consistent, high-quality delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;By bridging the gap between business goals and technical execution, you will define a clear technical vision, manage complex integrations, and partner with Architects to modernize the roadmap while reducing tech debt. Ultimately, you take full accountability for engineering deliverables, ensuring they are scalable, on schedule, and held to the highest standards of quality and excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build and take ownership of the Salesforce engineering team and drive excellence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Brainstorm ideas of how to improve training, process, hiring, etc&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Participate in your team’s coaching, personal development, performance management, and career growth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Set clear expectations and goals for team members and create opportunities for team members to showcase their work&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Facilitate team-building activities&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build an in-depth understanding of the code owned by the team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Encouraging knowledge sharing and collaboration&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Identify and address recurring issues in development cycles and improve speed of development.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure code quality and best practices&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Collaborate with Product Owners and stakeholders in understanding the requirements and translating them into technical designs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Provide high-level technical recommendations, approaches, and feedback.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Create and maintain project timelines&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Identify dependencies between different systems and facilitate communication between cross-functional teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Drive the execution and delivery of features by collaborating with many multi-functional teams, architects, product owners and engineers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Conduct risk assessments throughout the project’s lifecycle and provide updates to the stakeholder’s progress of each project you manage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Resolve cross-team coordination issues that may impact progress.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Manage expectations and negotiate scope changes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Facilitate decision-making processes when trade-offs are necessary&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
