&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong knowledge of Salesforce data modeling, reporting, and database design.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Has played the role of an Architect&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Demonstrated experience in building and maintaining integrations between Salesforce and external applications.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;3+ years of leading software engineering teams in an agile environment&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
