&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nu is one of the largest digital financial platforms in the world, with more than 127 million customers across Brazil, Mexico, and Colombia. Guided by our mission to fight complexity and empower people, we are redefining financial services in Latin America and this is still just the beginning of the purple future we&#39;re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE: NU), we combine proprietary technology, data intelligence, and an efficient operating model to deliver financial products that are simple, accessible, and human.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our impact has been recognized by global rankings such as Time 100 Companies, Fast Company’s Most Innovative Companies, and Forbes World’s Best Bank. Visit our institutional page &lt;a href=&quot;https://international.nubank.com.br/careers/&quot;&gt;https://international.nubank.com.br/careers/&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior IT Engineer to own the device management and inventory operations in Mexico — someone who knows our systems deeply, builds and improves them, and helps scale them globally. This is a hands-on engineering role: you will develop features, build automations, and act as the DevOps backbone for our MDM and inventory platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because you&#39;ll be based in Mexico City and will know these systems better than anyone on the ground, you&#39;ll also be the natural technical reference when regulatory conversations arise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Engineering &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own EE platforms in Mexico:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the development, maintenance, and continuous improvement of Endpoint Engineering platforms that power the device lifecycle in MX (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;Jamf Pro, Apple Business Manager/ADE, SnipeIT/Jira Assets, Assets inventory ecosystem, Zero Touch tooling, internal APIs&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build features &amp;amp; integrations:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement &lt;strong&gt;features, APIs, and data flows&lt;/strong&gt; that connect MDM, inventory, Jira Service Management, NuEx App, vendor systems, and other internal platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; self-service:&lt;/strong&gt; Create &lt;strong&gt;automations and self-service experiences&lt;/strong&gt; that eliminate manual work, reduce ticket load, and increase reliability for onboarding, replacements, and everyday device workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DevOps ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the &lt;strong&gt;DevOps owner&lt;/strong&gt; for these platforms in MX: manage infrastructure-as-code (Terraform/Ansible/Puppet or similar), CI/CD pipelines, configuration management, observability, and incident hooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metrics &amp;amp; outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and track key &lt;strong&gt;platform and experience metrics&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., ZTD success rate, Time-to-Productivity, ticket deflection, inventory correctness, audit readiness) and iterate based on data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day operations in MX:&lt;/strong&gt; Be the technical owner of the &lt;strong&gt;daily health, performance, and SLOs&lt;/strong&gt; of Endpoint Engineering platforms and device fleets in Mexico.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incidents &amp;amp; on-call:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead &lt;strong&gt;incident response&lt;/strong&gt; within the MX scope for EE platforms, coordinate with the global on-call rotation, and drive high-quality post-mortems and follow-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifecycle runbooks:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and continuously improve &lt;strong&gt;runbooks and documentation&lt;/strong&gt; for key device lifecycle journeys: onboarding, day-to-day support, replacements, offboarding, and &lt;strong&gt;panic/lost-stolen&lt;/strong&gt; flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-team execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with &lt;strong&gt;TechCenter, Global Security Operations, Global Services Platforms, REWS, Finance, and HR&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure asset lifecycle processes are executed consistently and safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively analyze observability signals (logs, metrics, alerts) to identify risks, bottlenecks, and opportunities for automation before they become incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Scale &amp;amp; Cross-functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner across NuEx and BAs:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with &lt;strong&gt;global Endpoint Engineering, NuEx, BA product/ops, Security, and infra/office tech teams&lt;/strong&gt; on initiatives like NuEx App, Jira governance, Atlas, and security foundations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale MX learnings:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn &lt;strong&gt;lessons learned in Mexico&lt;/strong&gt; into reusable patterns—playbooks, automations, data models, and dashboards—that can be adopted by Brazil, Colombia, and other regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring &amp;amp; bar-raising:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in &lt;strong&gt;hiring loops&lt;/strong&gt; (interviews, exercises, leveling feedback) for Endpoint Engineering roles, helping maintain and raise the engineering bar at Nubank.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor and pair with &lt;strong&gt;IC3/IC4 engineers&lt;/strong&gt; (and contractors where appropriate), reviewing designs and pull requests, and fostering a strong engineering culture in Endpoint Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory &amp;amp; Compliance Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As the deepest technical expert on the ground, serve as the reference point when regulatory bodies require explanations of our systems and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure platform documentation and configurations are audit-ready as a byproduct of good engineering hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for a person who has&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in &lt;strong&gt;Computer Science, Engineering, Information Systems&lt;/strong&gt;, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong hands-on experience administering and troubleshooting &lt;strong&gt;macOS, Windows, and Linux&lt;/strong&gt; in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming &amp;amp; scripting:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in at least one modern &lt;strong&gt;programming language&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Python, Clojure, Go, Java) and in &lt;strong&gt;scripting&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Shell Script); comfortable building services, tools, and automations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; backend:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience designing and operating &lt;strong&gt;cloud-based services on AWS&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Lambda, RDS, CloudWatch, Workspaces or similar) or another major cloud provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DevOps &amp;amp; IaC:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong &lt;strong&gt;DevOps fundamentals&lt;/strong&gt;—Git and CI/CD, containers (Docker), configuration management and infrastructure-as-code (Terraform, Ansible, Puppet or similar), and solid observability practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Databases:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with &lt;strong&gt;relational databases&lt;/strong&gt; (PostgreSQL, MariaDB, MySQL/SQL Server or similar) as part of building or integrating services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language &amp;amp; location:&lt;/strong&gt; Native or near-native Spanish, fluent English; legally authorized to work and resident in Mexico City, with willingness to work on-site multiple days per week.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Device Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MDM expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Production experience with &lt;strong&gt;Apple-focused MDM solutions&lt;/strong&gt; (Jamf Pro, Apple Business Manager/ADE) and &lt;strong&gt;Zero Touch Deployment&lt;/strong&gt; flows at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policy &amp;amp; compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to design, implement, and maintain &lt;strong&gt;endpoint security and compliance policies&lt;/strong&gt; via MDM and related tooling (e.g., certificates, identity agents, Zscaler or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Troubleshooting:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of debugging complex &lt;strong&gt;device setup and connectivity issues&lt;/strong&gt; (authentication, VPN, certificates, agents, network restrictions) across macOS, Windows, and mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory &amp;amp; Asset Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inventory platforms:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;IT inventory/asset management and CMDB platforms&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., SnipeIT, Jira Assets, ServiceNow, Device42 or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifecycle modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to model and operate &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end device lifecycle workflows&lt;/strong&gt; (procurement, onboarding, day-to-day, replacements, leasing, returns, offboarding, panic/lost-stolen) in tools like Jira Service Management and internal services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrations &amp;amp; data quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience integrating inventory data with &lt;strong&gt;HR, vendors, finance, and internal platforms&lt;/strong&gt;, and driving &lt;strong&gt;data quality and governance&lt;/strong&gt; to keep inventory audit-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Native&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Ease in using &lt;strong&gt;AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; as part of day-to-day work—exploring logs and metrics, prototyping automations, generating or refining runbooks and documentation, and improving support experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Willingness to &lt;strong&gt;experiment with AI/ML-powered approaches&lt;/strong&gt; to observability, incident response, and operational automation, while keeping security and compliance requirements in mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulated environments:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working in &lt;strong&gt;financial services, fintech, or other regulated industries&lt;/strong&gt;, including exposure to audits or regulatory reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Endpoint Eng stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Clojure microservices&lt;/strong&gt;, Zscaler or similar secure access solutions, and &lt;strong&gt;Zero Trust-style endpoint/identity architectures&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certifications:&lt;/strong&gt; Relevant certifications such as &lt;strong&gt;Linux (RHCE/LPIC), AWS, Jamf Pro, or security-related certifications&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; UX mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience partnering with &lt;strong&gt;product, UX, and operations&lt;/strong&gt; to run discoveries, talk to internal users, and instrument user experience metrics (e.g., CSAT, Time-to-Productivity, ticket deflection).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location for this opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mexico City, Mexico&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chance of earning equity at Nu&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended maternity and paternity leaves&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and life insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental and Vision Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NuCare - Our mental health and wellness assistance program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nucleo - Our learning platform of courses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NuLanguage - Our language learning program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holiday Bonus (&quot;Aguinaldo&quot;) of 30 days of pay per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;17 days of paid vacation with 25% vacation bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gym partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Food card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-from-home Allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Consultancy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation Assistance Package, if applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Model for this Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid 2-3 times/week&lt;/strong&gt;: Our hybrid work model brings us to the office at least twice a week, on strategic days designed to maximize team connection and collaboration. For more details, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://building.nubank.com/nu-hybrid-work-model/&quot;&gt;https://building.nubank.com/nu-hybrid-work-model/&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

qumracapital-appsflyer:greenhouse:848074.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand &amp;amp; Communications Manager - GCR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beijing, China&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a creative and driven public relations and digital communications marketer with a knack for landing major media hits and managing strategic communications and PR programs? Do you think BIG and are you passionate about mobile and marketing technology, with a desire to boost brand awareness, amplify the voice and enhance the position of a leading company that’s transforming an industry?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Brand &amp;amp; Communications manager with B2B experience -- preferably in the mobile or tech field -- to help drive traditional/ digital communications across a diverse range of verticals and markets throughout GCR. The ideal candidate has a hunger for creating compelling stories and ideas that garner attention from key industry and mainstream media, online communities, influencers, analysts and additional stakeholders. He or she thrives in a dynamic environment, is creative, data-driven, and an independent self-starter -- while knowing how to lead a team and agencies to orchestrate initiatives between regional and global marketing teams and their goals. This role will report directly to Sr. Director of Marketing, GCR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement fully integrated branding/communications plans in numerous markets across GCR – from strategy to tactics to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, leverage and prioritize opportunities to provide value that garners exposure in business, technology, marketing, advertising and mobile industries – and beyond&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate and scale AppsFlyer’s thought leadership, defining topics for engagement through bylines, speaking opportunities, rapid-response, media interviews, announcements, events, awards, white papers, digital interactions, co-marketing initiatives and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a central role in the company’s content creation using data; this includes China-specific blog posts, presentations, guides, data studies, white papers, videos, infographics, webinars, and press bylines. This also includes developing outlines, briefs, and ideas into effective, well-researched content pieces that make an impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage agencies and POCs throughout GCR, ensuring positioning and messages are conveyed effectively and consistently across various markets and channels, while constantly measuring results and optimizing for success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate relationships with partners, customers and 3rd parties in order to leverage joint PR/marketing efforts and grow the AppsFlyer community base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across the organization to employ communication strategies that align with key regional and global objectives (product launches, educational content &amp;amp; research reports on industry topics, conveying customer success stories, etc.) and strengthen the company’s overall narrative while maximizing impact on the AppsFlyer brand and business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience creating and executing integrated PR / communications strategy &amp;amp; plans across regional markets for a high-tech or international company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skill with growth mindset, good at managing stakeholders from different aspects and multitasking in a high-pace environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of prominent press placements, existing relationships with top technology, business and industry trade reporters, savvy at both media and influencer relations (traditional, social, digital)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional skills in writing, editing,with an ability to simplify complex data into actionable insights; as well as exceptional analytical and critical thinking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong story development skills, with an eye for detail and ability to drive stories with compelling visuals and messaging, providing spokesperson support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and interest in the worlds of tech, mobile, and digital marketing; Understanding of market trends and how to turn data into compelling stories, messages and campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise managing agencies and coordinating with internal and external stakeholders to drive terrific results, ensuring messages are conveyed effectively and consistently across channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native Chinese speaker and advanced proficiency in written and spoken English&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus points:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global 4A PR agency experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Communications, Journalism, Public Relations or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

qumracapital-connecteam:greenhouse:59767.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expansion SDR (XDR)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Connecteam is:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Connecteam is the leading platform for managing deskless teams, trusted by over 80,000 businesses worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We built Connecteam for real operators - the people running shifts, jobs, and teams across stores and sites. The kind of work that doesn’t happen behind a desk, and doesn’t have time for messy spreadsheets, scattered group chats, or tools that don’t talk to each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Connecteam brings daily operations and team communication into one intuitive app - from hiring and scheduling to training, tasks, and day-to-day coordination. It gives teams the clarity and control to run the day, shift after shift, job after job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Backed by $220M+ from Insights Partners, Stripes, and Tiger Global, Connecteam is rapidly expanding worldwide - empowering frontline teams to work smarter, stay connected, and operate with greater efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an Expansion SDR (XDR) at Connecteam, you’ll be at the heart of our growth efforts in the US market.&lt;br&gt;This is not a cold outbound role — you’ll work exclusively with &lt;strong&gt;existing paying customers&lt;/strong&gt;, uncovering opportunities to expand their use of Connecteam and ensuring they get maximum value from our platform. Your mission is to turn customer insights into meaningful conversations, and those conversations into high-quality demo bookings for our Account Managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively engage with existing customers via &lt;strong&gt;calls, email, and social&lt;/strong&gt; to identify upsell opportunities -&amp;nbsp; 140+ calls per day (exciting, high volume environment!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect into a defined target audience, focusing on accounts with &lt;strong&gt;high expansion potential&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Book qualified demos for the Expansion Account Managers, ensuring smooth handoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all prospecting activity in &lt;strong&gt;HubSpot CRM&lt;/strong&gt;, keeping records accurate and up to date.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Account Management team to share feedback on lead quality, potential new lead sources, and industry/product insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with outreach strategies to different customer segments (by size, industry, or usage) to drive more opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute ideas, insights, and energy to help shape our growing XDR team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–2 years&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;of experience in a client-facing role (SDR experience is a plus, not required) – MUST!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hunger for success, high energy, and an intelligent, positive, proactive attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical aptitude and the willingness to dive deep into the product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication, with the ability to clearly explain value propositions and tailor messaging to different customer personas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who thrives in a &lt;strong&gt;fast-paced, target-driven&lt;/strong&gt; startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience and adaptability when faced with challenges or rejection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable working US business hours: Monday–Friday, remotely - MUST!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working hours:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monday–Friday: 9:00am-6:00pm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers a competitive compensation of $&lt;strong&gt;60,000 per year base salary with $80,000 in on target earnings yearly with uncapped commission opportunity! &lt;/strong&gt;Along with Medical Coverage, Insurance plan, 401K, Paid time off for vacation, sick days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re passionate about helping businesses grow efficiently and have the required experience and skills, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Joining Connecteam Is The Smart Move:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We build our people up.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Every team member is treated as a long-term investment and we recognize the value in always nurturing and training them so they can go above and beyond in their skills and job duties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We make an impact on our customer’s business. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are on a mission to provide managers of all business types and sizes with the tools they need to communicate, operate, engage, and run their deskless workforce. Our product offers them an effective and affordable solution to run their business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We get the job done. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Connecteam employees are passionate in executing their job duties so they can drive the company forward and provide real value to our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have fun! &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;From weekly happy hours to holiday parties, we always enjoy each other’s company (and good food, of course). Connecteam is like one big, happy family!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Everyone is welcome. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Connecteam is committed to building an encouraging, caring, and supportive environment. We share a responsibility to support our team and enrich their lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together we will shape the future of work!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JivAppdCXE5QjtK_uWM9ue2834blvyfC/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Our privacy policy &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

remotely-bridgebio:greenhouse:5144754007.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mavericks Wanted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When was the last time you achieved the impossible? If that thought feels overwhelming, you might want to pause here, but if it sparks excitement...read on&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In 2015, we pioneered a “moneyball for biotech” approach, pooling projects and promising early-stage research from academia together under one financial umbrella to reduce risk and unleash innovation. This model allows science and small teams of experts to lead the way. We build bridges to groundbreaking advancements in rare&amp;nbsp;disease, and&amp;nbsp;develop life-changing medicines for patients with unmet needs as fast as humanly possible. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together we define white space, push boundaries, and empower people to solve problems. If you&#39;re someone who defies convention, join us and work alongside some of the most respected minds in the industry. Together, we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;ask&amp;nbsp;&quot;why not?&quot; and help reengineer the future of biopharma. At BridgeBio, we value curiosity and experimentation—including the ethical &amp;amp; thoughtful use of AI to improve clarity, speed, and quality of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BridgeBio is seeking a highly motivated and experienced individual to join as an Associate Director of Portfolio Intelligence. The role reports to Strategic Finance and Investor Relations and serves as an independent source of truth for executive leadership on the value, attractiveness, risks, and performance of key assets across the BridgeBio portfolio. The position is designed for an individual who can operate at the intersection of science, strategy, and finance, and translate complex analyses into clear recommendations for executive leadership and the Board.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly analytical role that will interrogate the entire BridgeBio portfolio through a strategic lens, Executive-level workstreams within BridgeBio. A successful candidate will demonstrate exceptional problem-solving ability, strong independent judgment, and the capacity to translate complex scientific and financial analyses into clear, decisive recommendations for executive leadership. We are looking for a hardworking and collaborative candidate that can thrive in a fast-paced environment with strong attention to detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Analytics &amp;amp; Forecasting:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop independent, analytically rigorous views on commercial performance of BridgeBio’s assets, including launch performance, market opportunity, competitive positioning, and revenue potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Benchmarking:&lt;/strong&gt; Track commercial performance against internal plans, Street expectations, peer launches, and other relevant analogues to identify key drivers of over- or under-performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market &amp;amp; Competitive Intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor market, competitive, regulatory, clinical, and investor developments that may affect asset value, launch trajectory, strategic positioning, or investor perception.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive &amp;amp; Board Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Synthesize complex commercial and financial analyses into clear recommendations for senior leadership, the Board, and other key stakeholders, including materials supporting earnings, Board meetings, investor questions, and major portfolio decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio Decision Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner internal teams to evaluate key portfolio decisions through scenario modeling, valuation, risk assessment, and assessment of strategic options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;u&gt;Where You&#39;ll Work&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an in-person role and requires in-office collaboration 4-5 days per week, primarily in our Palo Alto office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who You Are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: inherit !important;&quot;&gt;Mission-oriented: Motivated by the opportunity to help advance life-saving medicines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and hardworking: Thoughtful, diligent, committed to delivering high-quality work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focused on results: Willing to take ownership and see projects through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multitasker: Comfortable working across several high stakes workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated. Thrives in a dynamic, fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-oriented. Values collaboration and supports others across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in science, engineering, business, finance, economics, or a related analytical discipline required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced scientific or clinical degree, including PhD, MD, PharmD, or equivalent experience, strongly preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in commercial analytics. Prior experience in management consulting, investment banking, or healthcare investing (VC/PE) preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem-solving skills with a first-principles approach to complex scientific and business questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial analytics skillset, including experience with market sizing, patient flow, demand forecasting, launch tracking, competitive benchmarking, revenue forecasting, and performance diagnostics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to structure ambiguous problems and drive them to clear, actionable conclusions in high-stakes settings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep fluency in financial modeling and valuation is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with advanced techniques such as real options analysis, Monte Carlo simulation, or other quantitative frameworks is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills and the ability to manage multiple deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and persuasive communicator, both in writing and presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with industry data platforms like IQVIA or Komodo and financial data platforms like Bloomberg or Capital IQ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At BridgeBio, we strive to provide a market-competitive total rewards package, including base pay, an annual performance bonus, company equity, and generous health benefits. Below is the anticipated salary range for candidates for this role who will work in California. The final salary offered to a successful candidate will depend on several factors that may include but are not limited to the type and length of experience within the job, type, and length of experience within the industry, educational background, location of residence and performance during the interview process. BridgeBio is a multi-state employer, and this salary range may not reflect positions based in other states.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$210,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$232,900 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a global company, our comprehensive benefits may vary based on location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For Full-Time U.S Based Roles:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Rewards&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Market-leading compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;401(k) with employer match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
